.Dd March 27, 2026
.Dt TVG-LOTTIE2GIF 1
.Os thorvg
.Sh NAME
.Nm tvg-lottie2gif
.Nd convert Lottie animation files to GIF images
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar Lottie-file
.Op Ar Lottie-folder
.Op Fl r Ar resolution
.Op Fl f Ar fps
.Op Fl b Ar bgColor
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
converts Lottie animation JSON files to animated GIF images
using the ThorVG rendering engine.
.Pp
When given a directory, it recursively processes all
.Pa .json
Lottie files found within.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl r Ar WIDTHxHEIGHT
Set the output image resolution in pixels
.Pq e.g., Fl r Ar 600x600 .
Defaults to
.Ar 600x600 .
.It Fl f Ar NUM
Set the frames per second for the GIF output
.Pq e.g., Fl f Ar 30 .
Defaults to
.Ar 30 .
.It Fl b Ar HEXCOLOR
Set the background color as a hexadecimal value
without the
.Ql #
prefix
.Pq e.g., Fl b Ar fa7410 No for orange .
If not specified, the background is transparent.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Convert a single Lottie file:
.Pp
.Dl $ tvg-lottie2gif input.json
.Pp
Convert with custom resolution and frame rate:
.Pp
.Dl $ tvg-lottie2gif input.json -r 600x600 -f 30
.Pp
Convert all Lottie files in a directory with a background color:
.Pp
.Dl $ tvg-lottie2gif lottiefolder -r 600x600 -f 30 -b fa7410
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tvg-svg2png 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An ThorVG project
.Aq https://www.thorvg.org
.Pp
